  "data": {
    "pack": "Chapter Approved 2026-2027",
    "summary": "In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), any number of your units may start this [action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions), each in a different **[terrain area](vsdata:core-rule/terrain)**, if it is in range of an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** other than your **[home objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** or is within a **[terrain area](vsdata:core-rule/terrain)** outside your deployment zone not yet **trapped** by you. It completes at once: the **[terrain area](vsdata:core-rule/terrain)** becomes **trapped** and you set an **operation marker** of yours within it.",
